### When to Use Each Feature

| Feature             | Use Case                                         |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| **Chat Generation** | Conversational interfaces, customer support      |
| **Tool Calling**    | AI agents that need to read/write your data      |
| **MCP Servers**     | Agent integration, developer tools               |
| **ash_lua**         | Compositional agent tasks in one round-trip      |
| **Vectorization**   | Semantic search, similarity matching             |
| **RAG**             | AI answers grounded in your actual data          |
| **Reactor**         | Complex workflows, parallel processing, rollback |

